      "text": "Benefits\nEnhanced View-Through\nThe ClearView® fabric option provides superior view-through and UV protection with a specialized \nblack sheer that appears clear between fabric bands.\nIntelligent Design\nSheer and solid alternating bands are combined into a single fabric that transitions from open to \nclosed seamlessly, offering a modern solution for view-through, light control and privacy.\nBeautiful Light Control\nDesigner Banded Shades are available in light-filtering and light-dimming styles, so you can easily \nselect the opacity that fits your light control needs.\nEffortless Control\nPowerView® Automation moves your shades automatically according to schedules you set, morning, \nnoon and night.",
