      "category": "hardware",
      "text": "Banded Bottom Bar\nThe innovative bottom bar allows the shade to taper and narrow from \ntop to bottom, so the shade maintains band alignment and uniformity. \nAvailable fabric wrapped or unwrapped in 9 custom hardware colors.\nBanded Metal Bottom Bar\nThe sleek metal bottom bar comes standard with LiteRise® and is \noptional with all other operating systems.\nTop Treatments\nBottom Treatments\nWhite Tiara  661\nDuchess Grey  651\nRich Cream  320\nNickel  316\nDesert Tan  859\nCassette\nConceal the fabric roll with a contemporary aesthetic. Available in  \n9 custom hardware colors.\nBracket Profile\nMinimal yet modern design showcases the fabric roll and clean \nlines. Available in White Tiara and Black.\nBronze  064\nDesert Gold  903\nPearl Gray  879\nBlack  048\nCustom Hardware Colors\nCustom Hardware Colors\nUsed on all metal and plastic parts of the top and bottom treatments. All hardware colors are preselected to coordinate to each fabric in the collection.  \nColor override options are available. Colors may vary from printed samples, but are within accepted industry standards. \nBottom Bar Position\nBands Open\nWhen the fabric and sheer bands are aligned and \nthe shade is in the lowered position, the bottom \nbar will naturally rest above the window sill.\nBands Closed\nWhen fabric bands align with sheer bands \nand the shade is in the lowered position, the  \nbottom bar will rest closer to the window sill.",
